{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-77e9b138e41a246a4e2207084799b0c4","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0002","observation_sha256":"8432faa902e0566172100ef53e5dbbf58fe67b9b4a33bf4d9826d21625d28d89","ordinal":2,"provider_round":1,"question_sha256":"7a4181e08605bc3aa59d22706ab4ec0f548d57e41129738ade3a160c755a8353","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-77e9b138e41a246a4e2207084799b0c4","key_id":"0bd3c4d86edab284f3f64c0216a46fe53f5c482d0bd7be55f84304147faeaa12","ordinal":2,"provider_round":1,"question_sha256":"7a4181e08605bc3aa59d22706ab4ec0f548d57e41129738ade3a160c755a8353","receipt_mac":"e0d1081caf979dd6700c3ad3bc79742836c94fa08773a5dff5dbebb9e5d2c6fd","result_sha256":"bdc71ff162f9b300ecfe318be304d4f8cc75ebe1989ff9547b5e838b860f9c86","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":50,"path":"/memories","pattern":"Dave.*park|park.*Dave|parks"},"content":"/memories/session-01.md:L61: Dave: That's great, can't wait for you to return from your trip. I've been spending lots of time at this beautiful park lately - so calming. Have you been there before?\n/memories/session-03.md:L39: Dave: Sounds like an amazing plan, Cal! I can't wait for your trip to Boston. I'll show you around town and all the cool spots. The music scene there is awesome, with places like Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park. You'll definitely have some great performances there. Count me in for the front row when you're up onstage! Oh, and by the way, check out this pic.\n/memories/session-08.md:L23: Dave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\n/memories/session-08.md:L26: Calvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n/memories/session-08.md:L30: Dave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n/memories/session-08.md:L33: Calvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n/memories/session-10.md:L19: Dave: Glad to hear your car's fixed and going strong! I've been good too. Just been hanging out with friends at parks lately. I arranged with friends for regular walks together in the park.\n/memories/session-29.md:L18: Calvin: Remembering those days made me so nostalgic! Freestyling and talking about getting famous, it's crazy how life has changed. But being around certain people still sparks those same feelings. Take a look at how we freestyled when we were teenagers!\n/memories/session-30.md:L62: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! I found this serene spot in a nearby park and took this pic.","content_sha256":"ec0b222050742cee5ddbc7060de15cd0a557888fd79605cf47f2339766e7ed7f","coverage":[{"line_end":61,"line_start":61,"path":"/memories/session-01.md"},{"line_end":39,"line_start":39,"path":"/memories/session-03.md"},{"line_end":23,"line_start":23,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":26,"line_start":26,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":30,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":33,"line_start":33,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":19,"line_start":19,"path":"/memories/session-10.md"},{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-29.md"},{"line_end":62,"line_start":62,"path":"/memories/session-30.md"}],"post