{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-77e9b138e41a246a4e2207084799b0c4","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"3bb266da72f724578a9823d06d75a63b0ff8fbcc19090903efe1a42ae674948a","ordinal":3,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"7a4181e08605bc3aa59d22706ab4ec0f548d57e41129738ade3a160c755a8353","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-77e9b138e41a246a4e2207084799b0c4","key_id":"0bd3c4d86edab284f3f64c0216a46fe53f5c482d0bd7be55f84304147faeaa12","ordinal":3,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"7a4181e08605bc3aa59d22706ab4ec0f548d57e41129738ade3a160c755a8353","receipt_mac":"1dfc1d209c40f3d78590c5fcf884a7711811c5a99c17a0777a1b387124841670","result_sha256":"759e8984999243fdb05f810c5087f275697b59453e683032501b39787fd47b15","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":40,"path":"/memories/session-08.md","start_line":15},"content":"L15: Dave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\nL16: [Image caption: a photography of a pond with a boat in it surrounded by trees]\nL17: [S8T2] (dia_id: D8:2)\nL18: \nL19: Calvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\nL20: [Image caption: a photo of a recording studio with a large window and a desk]\nL21: [S8T3] (dia_id: D8:3)\nL22: \nL23: Dave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\nL24: [S8T4] (dia_id: D8:4)\nL25: \nL26: Calvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\nL27: [Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\nL28: [S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\nL29: \nL30: Dave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\nL31: [S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\nL32: \nL33: Calvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\nL34: [Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\nL35: [S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)\nL36: \nL37: Dave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill.\nL38: [S8T8] (dia_id: D8:8)\nL39: \nL40: Calvin: Nah, haven't been to the mountains but I'm keen to go. Looking for a way to escape it all and de-stress. I want to go on a hike to a place similar to this. What's new and exciting happening for you, Dave?","content_sha256":"d35839edaae079d3954316d07914f3ecdda0ec9f5c3188e1bed0af25daaccbd9","coverage":[{"line_end":40,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":26,"result_sha256":"759e8984999243fdb05f810c5087f275697b59453e683032501b39787fd47b15","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
