D10:4)\nL25: \nL26: Dave: Yeah, today we are going to that spot. Look at that lovely photo.\nL27: [Image caption: a photo of a city skyline with a river and boats in the water]\nL28: [S10T5] (dia_id: D10:5)\nL29: \nL30: Calvin: Wow, what a view! That sunset over the river is gorgeous. It must be so tranquil there. Reminds me of living in my Japanese mansion with the epic cityscape. It's like a dream come true! Look at this photo I took from my backyard of the mansion. It's so beautiful!","content_sha256":"92d2683b7d7473aca0b6320c7aebddc70a24b0921c2dc6e54449f6a602faa97e","coverage":[{"line_end":30,"line_start":10,"path":"/memories/session-10.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":21,"result_sha256":"2f0a466d31b2b66e4258d1dbdc5287499e7b44d15bd296726d1b62a3fedcdd37","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
